@ Hammers do not kill a Boo Circle's Boos (code/tweaks/ghost_hammer.cpp). The entry of
@ Enemy::collisionThrowableObject is `push {r4-r9, r11, lr}`, so the trampoline can replay it.

GhostHammer_collisionThrowableObject:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x002A68EC
    symbol:     ModBase::ghostHammer::collisionThrowableObject(Enemy*, ActiveCollider*, ActiveCollider*)
    trampoline: ModBase::ghostHammer::collisionThrowableObject_orig(Enemy*, ActiveCollider*, ActiveCollider*)
